  "description": "The Sommet, much like it’s Carbon brother is everything you need for the demands of enduro riding.\n\nNail the technical descent with new confidence thanks to the modern aggressive geometry and built to last spec. If you’re aiming for the enduro podium or want to push your riding to the limits on your favourite trail, the Sommet is with you all the way.\n\nThe Sommet 27 VR geometry is backed up by a slick performing components package. Including the brand new 170mm Manitou Mezzer Pro forks, 160mm Fox float DPS performance rear shock that pivots on a sealed upper bearing, SRAM SX 1×12 gearing and SRAM guide RE disc brakes.\n\nFinished off with high performance Maxxis 3C Tubeless ready tyres mounted on WTB ST Light i30 rims. No matter where you ride, the Sommet 27 VR will never be out of its depth.\n\nModern alloy frame with boost spacing and aggressive geometry\n\nSRAM Guide RE Brakes with 200mm rotors\n\nSRAM 1x12 SX Eagle groupset\n\nBrand-X Ascend Internal dropper post\n\nMetric Trunnion mount shock with sealed bearing upper shock mount\n\nMaxxis 3c Tubeless ready tyres with tubeless rim tape fitted and valves included",
